BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://tfl.gov.uk/tube-dlr-overground/status/?Input=&lineIds=&dateTypeSelect=Future%20date&direction=&startDate=2026-12-17T12:00:00&endDate=2026-12-18T11:59:00">Disruption map.</a>\n\nTUBE STRIKE: Some London Underground Tube drivers are planning to take strike action from 12:00 Thursday 17 until 11:59 Friday 18 December. There is likely to be some disruption across all Underground lines\, but trains are expected to run on most lines.
